mmany","x":409,"y":959,"width":156,"height":29}]},{"text":"입출력에 관련된 가장 기본적인 하드웨어 장치들은 버스, 장치 컨트롤러와 장치들","words":[{"text":"입출력에","x":352,"y":1039,"width":114,"height":34},{"text":"관련된","x":481,"y":1039,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"가장","x":584,"y":1039,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"기본적인","x":657,"y":1039,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"하드웨어","x":788,"y":1038,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"장치들은","x":922,"y":1038,"width":126,"height":34},{"text":"버스,","x":1065,"y":1039,"width":70,"height":35},{"text":"장치","x":1154,"y":1038,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"컨트롤러와","x":1238,"y":1038,"width":169,"height":34},{"text":"장치들","x":1421,"y":1038,"width":96,"height":34}]},{"text":"자신이다.","words":[{"text":"자신이다.","x":351,"y":1097,"width":124,"height":35}]},{"text":"• 장치들과 메모리 사이의 자료 이동은 프로그램된 입출력으로서 CPU에 의해 직접","words":[{"text":"•","x":313,"y":1173,"width":14,"height":14},{"text":"장치들과","x":350,"y":1164,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"메모리","x":482,"y":1165,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"사이의","x":583,"y":1165,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"자료","x":684,"y":1166,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"이동은","x":759,"y":1165,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"프로그램된","x":861,"y":1164,"width":152,"height":34},{"text":"입출력으로서","x":1032,"y":1163,"width":189,"height":35},{"text":"CPU에","x":1240,"y":1162,"width":113,"height":34},{"text":"의해","x":1373,"y":1163,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"직접","x":1456,"y":1163,"width":56,"height":33}]},{"text":"이루어지거나 DMA 컨트롤러에 의해 이루어진다.","words":[{"text":"이루어지거나","x":351,"y":1222,"width":176,"height":34},{"text":"DMA","x":536,"y":1225,"width":83,"height":27},{"text":"컨트롤러에","x":633,"y":1222,"width":143,"height":35},{"text":"의해","x":790,"y":1223,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"이루어진다.","x":861,"y":1222,"width":159,"height":34}]},{"text":"• 이때 장치를 제어하는 커널 모듈이 바로 장치 컨트롤러이다. 우우 교무 그램의 장치","words":[{"text":"•","x":311,"y":1297,"width":14,"height":13},{"text":"이때","x":350,"y":1289,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"장치를","x":422,"y":1289,"width":88,"heigh